# Wiki-first agent context (Cursor)

1. **Retrieve** large program/consumer docs via **`centex-program-wiki`** (`wiki_search` / `wiki_content_read` / `wiki_resolve`). Do **not** `Read()` full SSOT trees or paste **COMPREHENSIVE** / rule packs into chat.
2. **Git** `docs/` + `.cursor/rules/` remain merge authority. If **`wiki_resolve`** returns **`exists: false`**, re-ingest or `@` the git path ([wiki/README.md](https://github.com/centexmsp/repository-restructuring/blob/main/wiki/README.md) **§4–§5a**).
3. **Continue:** [CONTINUE_OPERATOR_PASTE_SSOT.md](https://github.com/centexmsp/repository-restructuring/blob/main/docs/CONTINUE_OPERATOR_PASTE_SSOT.md). Do **not** edit **`AGENTS.md`** unless a local verify command changed. Gate IDs belong in verify scripts.
4. **Stay under the 200k Grok price cliff.** New chat after Cursor summarizes or **Input token limit exceeded**.
5. **Mount broken / empty `wiki_spaces_list`:** `./scripts/verify-wiki-mcp-cursor-mount.sh` then `./scripts/merge-cursor-mcp-wiki-centex.sh`. Session start still runs the mount check ([OPERATOR_SESSION_START_AND_IDE_REALITY_SSOT.md](https://github.com/centexmsp/repository-restructuring/blob/main/docs/OPERATOR_SESSION_START_AND_IDE_REALITY_SSOT.md) **§A**). MCP servers stay enabled — query them; do not dump schemas.
6. **Duplicate Cloudflare MCP:** if Features → MCP lists **`plugin-cloudflare-*` and `user-cloudflare-*` for the same product, disable the plugin copies** ([MCP hub §1g](https://github.com/centexmsp/repository-restructuring/blob/main/docs/MCP_AND_CLOUDFLARE_VERIFICATION_HUB_SSOT.md)). They double the always-on tool catalog (~26k chars).
7. **Token wall:** a fresh chat can already sit near **140k** tokens; tool history fills the rest. Grok 4.7 and 4.6 are **500k** context ([models](https://docs.x.ai/developers/models)), and the program price cliff is **200k**. New chat after Cursor summarizes, after ~40–50 tool turns, or at that cliff. Long Build loop is **grok-build-0.1**, not a third chat model. Do not switch the chat default to **grok-4.3**.
